<title>ITALY: Olivetti sells venture capital interests.</title>
<headline>Olivetti sells venture capital interests.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olivetti said it sold its outstanding venture capital investments in high tech companies in the United States for $54 million.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the sale was completed last year and that it had received $48.3 million on December 31 1996 with the balance to be paid in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The capital gain on the purchase of the holdings was around $21 million.</p>
<p>The company also said it raised about four billion lire from the sale of the non-Italian operations of Decision Systems International. Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
